'@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 统计与可视化用例
left to right direction
skinparam useCaseShape rectangle

actor "系统" as S
actor "管理员" as A
actor "最高管理者" as SA

usecase "生成统计报表" as GR
usecase "查看使用率" as VU
usecase "导出 CSV" as EXP
usecase "用户充电统计" as UCS

S --> GR
A --> GR
A --> VU
A --> EXP
A --> UCS
SA --> GR
SA --> VU
SA --> EXP
SA --> UCS

GR <.down. VU : <<include>>
EXP ..> GR : <<extend>>

note right of GR : 收入统计报表（含财务数据）仅限最高管理者(SA)\n使用率分析、用户充电统计 管理员(A)及以上可查看
@enduml